/// Returns information about the specified global table. This documentation
/// is for version 2017.11.29 (Legacy) of global tables, which should be
/// avoided for new global tables. Customers should use Global Tables
/// version 2019.11.21 (Current) when possible, because it provides greater
/// flexibility, higher efficiency, and consumes less write capacity than
/// 2017.11.29 (Legacy). To determine which version you're using, see
/// Determining the global table version you are using . To update existing
